<title>FRANCE: EU wheat bids with taxes in Denmark, Greece - trade.</title>
<headline>EU wheat bids with taxes in Denmark, Greece - trade.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exporters in Denmark and Greece placed bids to export a total 4,500 tonnes of free market soft wheat with taxes at today's EU grain tenders, grain traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>But traders said they did not did not know the level of the taxes.</p>
</text>
